    "detailed_description": "\u201cWarOFuture\u201d is an online two-player card and chess game. You need to use pre-build magic decks and chess units to play against with each other. Taking advantage of the unique &quot;flipping&quot; characteristics of the chess pieces to get a unique game experience!<br><br><strong> \u00b7 Chesses that can be flipped: </strong> Your chess has the <strong> &quot;flipped&quot; </strong> characteristic. If it's <strong> &quot;un-flipped&quot; </strong>, the opponent cannot see the specific information of the piece. The winning goal of the game is to kill the &quot;crystal&quot;. You can use this characteristic to hide your chesses, or use the unique &quot;flip ability&quot; of the chess piece to surprise your opponent!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/de5f21f441b0aab122298e1751b87af4.poster.avif?t=1745496211\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/de5f21f441b0aab122298e1751b87af4.webm?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/de5f21f441b0aab122298e1751b87af4.mp4?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/29dc08b0a1c22580f8dba2590a4b661c.poster.avif?t=1745496211\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/29dc08b0a1c22580f8dba2590a4b661c.webm?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/29dc08b0a1c22580f8dba2590a4b661c.mp4?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong> Positioning different professions: </strong> Different chess pieces have unique characteristics and <strong> &quot;flipping abilities&quot; </strong>, causing powerful attacks, obtaining opponent information, and even causing large-scale control effects. It's up to you to make good use of the coordination between chess pieces.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/1f652e27b52fead7d7fe04a923fedf3c.poster.avif?t=1745496211\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/1f652e27b52fead7d7fe04a923fedf3c.webm?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/1f652e27b52fead7d7fe04a923fedf3c.mp4?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/55f4ff6a01d6b4556e14aa97f88250ee.poster.avif?t=1745496211\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/55f4ff6a01d6b4556e14aa97f88250ee.webm?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/extras/55f4ff6a01d6b4556e14aa97f88250ee.mp4?t=1745496211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong> Rich card selection:  </strong> Presets of magic cards from three color systems, powerful red cards for killing, blue cards for field control skills, and green cards for protecting and obtaining resources. They combine with chess pieces to achieve excellent results.<br><br><strong> Diverse chessboard venues: </strong> Rivers in the forest slow down the movement, volcanic magma directly causes destructive damage, and desert quicksand changes the position of chess. Different gameplay of the maps can bring a completely different gaming experience!",
